# Auth core

`src/lib/auth-core.ts` is generated from `harness/fragments/auth-core/`. It is not a package and not a repo.

## Do

- Verify platform JWTs and resolve admin permissions with `createAuthCore`.
- Change the source under `harness/fragments/auth-core/` and run `node harness/scripts/sync.mjs`.
- Treat a missing auth binding or a failed RPC as HTTP 503.

## Do not

- Edit `src/lib/auth-core.ts` in a worker.
- Reimplement JWT verification or RBAC beside the core.
- Return `"*"` or allow a request when authorization fails.
